    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out also other games:</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/ed35e846840eebfa4631a32550e8222b.avif?t=1747660697\" /></div><br><br>As a Barn&amp;Farm Renovator you can:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Buy dilapidated or abandoned barns and turn them into modern homes.</li></ul>Make profits on their sale and invest in more barns to flip. Your customers\u2019 expectations and requirements will often surprise you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/eb9cf6208c1271436cfecefab8d5a1a7.poster.avif?t=1747660697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/eb9cf6208c1271436cfecefab8d5a1a7.webm?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/eb9cf6208c1271436cfecefab8d5a1a7.mp4?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You have a limited number of days and cash to transform an old barn into your customers\u2019 dream home.</li></ul>If you exceed the time and budget allotted, they will not be happy. If you finish earlier, you can count on a generous bonus.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/4a2e3ed0767660f147fdefe5b4065993.poster.avif?t=1747660697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/4a2e3ed0767660f147fdefe5b4065993.webm?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/4a2e3ed0767660f147fdefe5b4065993.mp4?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You won\u2019t get much done without proper tools like:</li></ul>Cordless screwdriver, wood saw, paintbrushes, power drill, nail gun, trowels, saws, jigsaw, levels and others will come in handy\u2026<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/a3370255e0754251523611e9887591d7.poster.avif?t=1747660697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/a3370255e0754251523611e9887591d7.webm?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/a3370255e0754251523611e9887591d7.mp4?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u2026but the Final Touch is totally up to you.</li></ul>Everything needs to be pimped out and spiffy but also in its right spot \u2013 furniture, home appliances and entertainment centers, house plants \u2013 all very stylish and chic. Don\u2019t fret; there is lots of free space for improvisation and distinctive d\u00e9cor.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/38fc7a58835e09b97ca290f300394840.poster.avif?t=1747660697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/38fc7a58835e09b97ca290f300394840.webm?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/38fc7a58835e09b97ca290f300394840.mp4?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Before closing the deal, remember to get rid of any pests and uninvited guests too (critters from nearby fields and forests).</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/917cbef8e19ef04a7bc3d5717b9e4666.poster.avif?t=1747660697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/917cbef8e19ef04a7bc3d5717b9e4666.webm?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/917cbef8e19ef04a7bc3d5717b9e4666.mp4?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
