y muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/917cbef8e19ef04a7bc3d5717b9e4666.poster.avif?t=1747660697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/917cbef8e19ef04a7bc3d5717b9e4666.webm?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603210/extras/917cbef8e19ef04a7bc3d5717b9e4666.mp4?t=1747660697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
